{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%@ did not accept the sign-in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 没有接受这个登录凭据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ has a question": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 有一个问题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is not on this Mac, but its hooks are connected. Other agents run them too (Cursor does, unless told not to); their sessions are shown as theirs. Remove them if you do not use %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 上没有 %@，但它的钩子是接好的。别的代理也会执行这些钩子（Cursor 默认就会），它们的会话会记在它们自己名下。如果你不用 %@，可以移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is out": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已发布"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ keeps the plan's limits on its own servers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 把套餐的额度记在它自己的服务器上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ needs you": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 在等你"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ open, with nothing happening in the last %lld minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@已打开，最近 %lld 分钟内没有动静。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ tabs need Automation: Settings → General": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 标签页需要“自动化”权限：设置 → 通用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ tokens": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ tokens"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ tokens in and out, %@ more read from the cache": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入和输出 %@ token，另有 %@ 从缓存读取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ wants to edit %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 想要编辑 %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ wants to fetch a URL": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 想要抓取一个网址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ wants to read %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 想要读取 %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ wants to run a command": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 想要运行一条命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ wants to search the project": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 想要搜索项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ wants to start a sub-agent": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 想要启动一个子代理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ wants to use %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 想要使用 %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ was turned away": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 被限流拒绝了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ window %lld percent used": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 窗口已用 %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@%% an hour": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每小时 %@%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@%% an hour: about %lld%% by the reset": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每小时 %@%%：到重置时约用掉 %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@%% an hour: runs out in about %@, before the reset": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每小时 %@%%：约 %@ 后用完，早于重置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@'s limit has reset": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的额度已重置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@: %@ %lld%% used": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@：%@已用 %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@: %@ runs out in about %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@：%@约 %@ 后用完"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@: %lld sessions, %@ prompts, %@ tool calls": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@：%lld 个会话，%@ 条提示词，%@ 次工具调用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@: hooks put back": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@：被移走的钩子已放回"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@: nothing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@：没有活动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld agents on this Mac are not connected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 上有 %lld 个代理尚未接入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld days ago": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 天前"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld days in a row": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连续 %lld 天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld finished": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个已完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld helpers": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个子代理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld min": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 分钟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld min ago": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 分钟前"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld of %lld steps done": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已完成 %lld / %lld 步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld resets left": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还可重置 %lld 次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld resets saved": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存有 %lld 次重置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld s": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld sessions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld sessions · %@ prompts · %@ tool calls in 7 days": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "7 天里 %lld 个会话 · %@ 条提示词 · %@ 次工具调用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld waiting": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个在等待"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld waiting for your decision": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 项等待你决定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld-day limit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 天限额"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld-hour limit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 小时限额"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lldd %lldh": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 天 %lld 小时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lldh %lldm": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 小时 %lld 分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lldh %lldm ago": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 小时 %lld 分钟前"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "+ %@ read from cache": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另有 %@ 从缓存读取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "+ %lld more": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另有 %lld 项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "10 min": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10 分钟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "12 months": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "12 个月"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2 hours": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2 小时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "24h ago": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "24 小时前"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "30 days": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "30 天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "30 min": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "30 分钟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "5 hours": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5 小时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "5-hour limit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5 小时限额"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "7 days": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "7 天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "8 hours": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "8 小时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "8-bit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "8-bit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A card comes down with what the agent said last, and a click on it goes to the session. A notice only names the session. Neither opens the island or takes focus.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卡片会带着代理最后说的话落下来，点一下就回到那个会话；提示只显示会话名称。两者都不会展开灵动岛，也不会抢走焦点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A card stays twice as long, and for as long as the pointer is on it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卡片停留的时间是它的两倍；指针停在卡片上时不会消失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A key is saved in your Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密钥已保存在你的钥匙串里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A line to your phone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "给手机发一行消息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A link starts with the app's own scheme (like vscode:), not http or file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "链接要以应用自己的协议开头（比如 vscode:），不能是 http 或 file。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A newer version can be installed from Settings → About.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以在“设置 → 关于”里安装新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A percentage where the agent says how large the model's window is (Codex), a size where it does not (Claude Code). Once it is nearly full it shows by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理写明了模型窗口大小时显示百分比（Codex），没写时显示大小（Claude Code）。快满的时候会自己出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A permission request or a question is waiting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有权限请求或提问在等你处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rate-limit window passed 90%.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "某个速率限制窗口已用掉 90%。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A redacted report you can attach to an issue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一份已脱敏的报告，可以附在 Issue 里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A reset is spent in %@ itself. This only brings it to the front.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重置要在 %@ 里使用，这里只是把它带到前台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A search box over everything: type part of a project, a prompt or an agent, then ↩ to go there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浮在一切之上的搜索框：输入项目、提示词或代理的一部分，按 ↩ 直接过去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A session in one of these folders, or whose first prompt contains one of these words, is not listed, plays no sound and sends nothing. What it asks for is left to the agent's own prompt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "位于这些文件夹里、或首条提示词包含这些词的会话：不显示、不出声、不推送。它的请求交给代理自己的提示处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A session that has stopped gets a line to type a follow-up into. It is sent into the terminal the agent runs in, as if typed there: a tmux pane, an iTerm2 session or a Terminal tab, and only while the agent itself is waiting at that prompt. Sessions in a desktop app have no such way in. macOS will ask before the first one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停下来的会话会多出一行输入框，可以直接写后续指令。内容会像你亲手输入一样，送进代理所在的终端：tmux 窗格、iTerm2 会话或“终端”标签页，而且只在代理自己正等在提示符前时才发送。桌面端里的会话没有这样的入口。第一次发送前 macOS 会先询问你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A short cue when an agent needs you or finishes. Generated by the app, off unless you want them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理需要你或完成时的一声提示。由应用自己合成，你不开就不会响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A sign-in for your server is saved in your Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你服务器的登录信息已保存在钥匙串里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A turn ended because something failed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "某一轮因为出错而结束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activity per day, last 26 weeks": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近 26 周每天的活动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activity, 26 weeks": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "活动，26 周"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds the tool and command being asked for, or the first line of a reply. Off: none of that leaves this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "附上请求的工具和命令，或回复的第一行。关闭时，这些内容都不会离开这台 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After %lld min": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 分钟后"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After this long, a request still on the island goes back to the agent's own prompt, answered by nobody, so an agent is never stuck on a card you did not see.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超过这个时间还没回答的请求，会交还给代理自己的提示，不替你做任何决定，这样代理不会卡在一张你没看到的卡片上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent or app": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理或应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents keep working; waiting requests go back to their terminals.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
