    "Amber beneath the closed island while someone waits on you, your accent while agents work, and a light along its edge.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有人在等你时，收起的岛屿下透出琥珀色光晕；代理干活时是你的强调色，并有一道光沿着底边划过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Amp's plugin API is experimental and runs in its command-line app only: reload plugins in Amp (or start it again) to load ours.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amp 的插件接口还是实验性的，并且只在它的命令行程序里运行：在 Amp 里重新加载插件（或重新启动它）才会载入我们的插件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An agent asks a question": {
