      }
    },
    "Checked while %@ is open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 打开时才能检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Alerts: a permission request can then be answered on the banner": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "样式选“提醒”：权限请求就能直接在横幅上回答"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a folder…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择文件夹…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose any that apply": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可多选"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Classic": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "经典"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code and Codex sessions show up even when they are idle, were started before this app, or run in a desktop app that is not connected. The logs are only read, on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即使会话处于空闲、在本应用启动之前就已开始，或者运行在尚未接入的桌面端里，Claude Code 和 Codex 的会话也会显示。日志只在这台 Mac 上读取，不做任何修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code could not be run, or took too long.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code 没能运行，或者用时太长。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code has not signed in on this Mac, so there is nothing to ask with.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code 还没有在这台 Mac 上登录，所以没有可用来查询的凭据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code is looking…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code 正在查询…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code looked, and the figures above are its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code 查过了，上面就是它自己的数字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code ran but kept no new answer. If it has never signed in on this Mac, run claude once in a terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code 运行了，但没有留下新的结果。如果它从没在这台 Mac 上登录过，请先在终端里运行一次 claude。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code's sign-in on this Mac has run out. It renews itself the next time Claude Code runs in a terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code 在这台 Mac 上的登录已过期。下次在终端里运行 Claude Code 时它会自己续期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click a session and its terminal tab or app comes forward. Sessions show up even for agents you have not connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点一下会话，对应的终端标签页或应用就回到前台。没有接入的代理，会话也会显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click to go to the session": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击回到会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clicking a session brings its own %@ tab to the front.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击会话会把它自己的 %@ 标签页带到前面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clicking a session brings its terminal tab forward where the terminal allows it (Terminal, iTerm2, tmux, WezTerm, and kitty with remote control on); elsewhere its app. A rule here opens a link instead, for sessions of one agent or in one app. {cwd}, {project}, {session} and {agent} are filled in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击会话时，终端支持的话会切到它所在的标签页（终端、iTerm2、tmux、WezTerm，以及开启了远程控制的 kitty），否则切到它所在的应用。这里的规则会改为打开一个链接，可按代理或应用设置。{cwd}、{project}、{session}、{agent} 会被自动填入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex has not signed in with a ChatGPT plan on this Mac, so there is nothing to ask with.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex 还没有在这台 Mac 上用 ChatGPT 套餐登录，所以没有可用来查询的凭据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex runs a new hook only after you trust it: type /hooks in Codex and trust the niko-bridge entries.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex 只有在你信任之后才会运行新的钩子：在 Codex 里输入 /hooks，信任带 niko-bridge 的条目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex's own files already say most of it. This adds a current answer while Codex is idle, and the resets your account has saved. Reads the ChatGPT sign-in Codex keeps on this Mac and sends it to chatgpt.com, nowhere else. Asked every five minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex 自己的文件已经记了大部分。打开后，Codex 空闲时也能拿到最新数字，还能看到账号里存着的重置次数。读取 Codex 存在这台 Mac 上的 ChatGPT 登录凭据，只发送到 chatgpt.com，不发往别处。每五分钟查询一次。"
