    "Hooks cannot start the bridge until the flag is cleared. Run this once in a terminal, then reopen the app:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在清除隔离标记之前，钩子无法启动桥接程序。请在终端里执行一次下面的命令，然后重新打开应用："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How fast it opens and closes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
