        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示停留多久"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long the pointer has to rest": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指针需要停留多久"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many of this month's credits are spent, and free-trial or bonus credits. Reads the sign-in Kiro keeps on this Mac (~/.aws/sso/cache/kiro-auth-token.json and Kiro's profile), only while it is still good, and sends it to Kiro (management.us-east-1.kiro.dev or management.eu-central-1.kiro.dev), nowhere else. It is never renewed here. Asked every ten minutes while Kiro is in use. What Kiro spent per turn is counted from its own session files either way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本月积分用了多少，以及试用积分和赠送积分。读取 Kiro 保存在这台 Mac 上的登录凭据（~/.aws/sso/cache/kiro-auth-token.json 和 Kiro 的账户配置），只在它还没过期时发送给 Kiro（management.us-east-1.kiro.dev 或 management.eu-central-1.kiro.dev），不发往别处，也绝不在这里续期。Kiro 在使用时每十分钟查询一次。无论开不开，每一轮花了多少积分都会从 Kiro 自己的会话文件里统计。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of a plan is used up is known to the provider, not to this Mac (Codex is the exception: it writes its limits into its own session files). Each switch below gets them from one place, with your own sign-in, and keeps nothing but percentages and reset times. All of them are off until you turn them on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "套餐用了多少，只有厂商知道，这台 Mac 上并没有记录（Codex 例外：它会把额度写进自己的会话文件）。下面每个开关各从一个地方取得这些数字，用的是你自己的登录，只保留百分比和恢复时间。所有开关默认都是关闭的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the included usage this billing cycle is spent, for Auto and for the named models, and on-demand spending if it is on. Reads the sign-in Cursor's app keeps on this Mac (its own settings database, read only) and sends it to cursor.com, nowhere else. Asked every ten minutes while Cursor is in use.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本计费周期内含额度用了多少（Auto 与指定模型分开），以及打开了的话按需付费的花费。读取 Cursor 应用保存在这台 Mac 上的登录凭据（它自己的设置数据库，只读），只发送到 cursor.com。Cursor 在使用时每十分钟查询一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How soon it closes after the pointer leaves": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指针离开后多久收起"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Included usage, this cycle": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内含额度，本计费周期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install and restart": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装并重启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install one, then connect it from Settings. The island also finds Claude Code, Codex and ZCode sessions by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先安装一个，再到设置里接入。小岛也会自己发现 Claude Code、Codex 和 ZCode 的会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installing…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在安装…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Island": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "岛屿"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Island and 8-bit are generated by the app itself; no audio files are bundled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“岛屿”和“8-bit”两套音效由应用自己合成，没有打包任何音频文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It closes again when the pointer leaves.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指针离开后会自动收起。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It never takes keyboard focus away from what you are typing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它不会抢走你正在输入的键盘焦点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its hooks were taken out and could not be put back: %@. Press Connect once the file can be written again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它的钩子被移走了，且没能放回：%@。等文件可以写入后，点一下「接入」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its limit has reset. It can work again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "额度已重置，可以继续了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep a quiet session listed for": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安静的会话保留"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the island visible when nothing is running": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有会话时也保持岛屿可见"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kimi Code keeps its sign-in to itself, so this needs an API key of your Kimi Code plan. It is stored in your Keychain and sent to api.kimi.com, nowhere else.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kimi Code 不对外提供它的登录凭据，所以这里需要你 Kimi Code 套餐的 API 密钥。密钥存在你的钥匙串里，只会发送到 api.kimi.com。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kimi Code reads its hooks when a session starts: sessions that are already open stay as they are.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kimi Code 在会话开始时读取钩子：已经开着的会话保持原样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kiro has not signed in on this Mac, so there is nothing to ask with.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kiro 还没有在这台 Mac 上登录，没有可以用来查询的凭据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kiro runs global hook files in its app and from version 3 of its CLI; an older Kiro CLI does not.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kiro 应用和第 3 版起的 Kiro CLI 会运行全局钩子文件；更早的 Kiro CLI 不会。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kiro's sign-in on this Mac has run out. It renews itself while Kiro runs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kiro 在这台 Mac 上的登录已过期。Kiro 运行时会自己续期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Language": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语言"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Large": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last 24 hours": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近 24 小时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let Claude Code look up my Claude limits": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让 Claude Code 自己查询我的 Claude 额度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Limit close": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "额度告急"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Limits": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "限额"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Limits the provider keeps": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "厂商那边的额度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lines of the agent's last reply": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理最后回复显示几行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Long": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外观"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make it yours": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调成你喜欢的样子"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Medium": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Midnight": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "午夜"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moments": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "时刻"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mon": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mute sounds": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "静音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "My files": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我的文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Named models, this cycle": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指定模型，本计费周期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs an API key of your MiniMax Coding Plan. It is stored in your Keychain and sent only to the service chosen below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要你 MiniMax Coding Plan 的 API 密钥。密钥存在你的钥匙串里，只会发送到下面选择的服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs you": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要你"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs your decision": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要你来决定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs your decision: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要你来决定：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs your permission": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要你的许可"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Never": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从不"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New session": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下一步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next to the project's name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示在项目名称旁边。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Niko Island Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Niko Island 设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Niko Island could not start listening": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Niko Island 无法开始监听"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Coding Plan key has been added yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有添加 Coding Plan 的密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No agents found yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有发现代理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No agents running yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有正在运行的代理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No analytics, no crash reports, no update checks. Events are kept in memory; the usage database holds numbers and identifiers only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有统计、没有崩溃上报、没有更新检查。事件只保存在内存里；用量数据库只存数字和标识符。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No banner appears while the session's own terminal is in front.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当该会话所在的终端就在前台时，不会弹出横幅。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No claude program was found on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 上没有找到 claude 程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No price known for: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以下模型暂无价格：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No session matches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有匹配的会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No sessions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No sessions yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No sounds and no cards while nobody is there to notice. Requests still wait for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没人在看的时候不播放声音，也不弹卡片。请求会一直等你回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No sounds and nothing sent to a phone between these times. The island itself shows what it always shows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这段时间内不播放声音，也不往手机发消息。灵动岛本身照常显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No sounds, no cards, nothing to the phone. Also from a link, for Shortcuts or a Focus automation: nikoisland://quiet?minutes=60, and nikoisland://quiet/off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不出声、不弹卡片、不推送到手机。也可以用链接控制，方便接入快捷指令或专注模式自动化：nikoisland://quiet?minutes=60，以及 nikoisland://quiet/off。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No supported agent was found in your home directory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在你的主目录里没有找到受支持的代理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No usage found yet. Numbers appear after an agent has written a transcript on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有用量数据。代理在这台 Mac 上写下会话记录后，这里就会出现数字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No wait": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不等待"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "None": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂不接入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not sent: its terminal is not waiting for input": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未发送：它的终端此刻没有在等待输入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不提示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing happens until you decide. The agent is waiting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在你做出决定之前什么都不会发生，代理正在等待。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing has been sent yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有发送过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing is connected yet. Connecting changes nothing until you say so.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有接入任何代理。在你确认之前，接入不会改动任何东西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notice": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "简短提示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notify me when": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在这些时候通知我"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. Each moment below can be switched on its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭。下面每个时刻都可以单独开关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. It downloads a public list of prices and sends nothing about you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭。它只下载一份公开的价格表，不会发送任何与你有关的信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: a plain dot in each agent's colour. The Pixel style draws them in pixels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭：每个代理显示为一个它颜色的圆点。像素主题会用像素画出它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: it appears only while there are sessions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭后，只有存在会话时它才会出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: only when one needs a decision or has a question.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭时，只在需要你决定或有问题要问时才发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Older quiet sessions on one line": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "较早的空闲会话显示为一行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On-demand spending": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按需付费"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once per window and cycle, on the island and to your phone if that is on. A warning also comes when the recent pace would use a window up before it resets.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个窗口每个周期只提醒一次，显示在小岛上，开启了手机推送的话也会推送。按最近的速度会在重置前用完时，也会提前提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One creature and a few words. It rests on your menu bar and leaves with it when an app goes full screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一只小生物加几个字。它停在菜单栏上，应用进入全屏时随菜单栏一起离开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only an installed app can replace itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有安装好的应用才能替换自己。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only for a request the island is showing: with the island closed, the first press opens it. The keys are left to other apps while nothing is waiting. Questions are never answered this way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只对灵动岛正在显示的请求生效：灵动岛收起时，第一次按键只会把它展开。没有请求在等待时，这两个快捷键留给其他应用使用。提问永远不会用这种方式回答。"
