    "Premium requests, chat and completions for the month. Reads the sign-in the GitHub CLI (gh) keeps on this Mac (in ~/.config/gh, or your Keychain: macOS may ask you first) and sends it to api.github.com, nowhere else. Asked every ten minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本月的高级请求、聊天和代码补全额度。读取 GitHub CLI（gh）在这台 Mac 上保存的登录凭据（在 ~/.config/gh 里，或在钥匙串里：macOS 可能会先询问你），只发送到 api.github.com。每十分钟查询一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Premium requests, monthly": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高级请求，每月"
          }
        }
      }
