    },
    "Reads the sign-in Claude Code keeps in your Keychain (macOS may ask you first) and sends it to api.anthropic.com, nowhere else. Asked every five minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取 Claude Code 存在钥匙串里的登录凭据（macOS 可能会先询问你），只发送到 api.anthropic.com，不发往别处。每五分钟查询一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads the sign-in Gemini CLI saved on this Mac (in ~/.gemini, or your Keychain: macOS may ask you first) and sends it to cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com, nowhere else, while it is still good. It is never renewed here: Gemini CLI does that the next time it runs. Asked every five minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取 Gemini CLI 在这台 Mac 上保存的登录凭据（在 ~/.gemini 里，或在钥匙串里：macOS 可能会先询问你），在它没过期时只发送到 cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com。本应用绝不为它续期：下次运行时 Gemini CLI 会自己续期。每五分钟查询一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refresh the model price list from the network (weekly)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从网络更新模型价格表（每周一次）"
