            "value": "行距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs your own claude program with /usage, every five minutes while a Claude Code session is listed. Claude Code asks Anthropic with its own sign-in, exactly as when you type /usage, and this app reads the answer it keeps in ~/.claude.json. The sign-in is never read by this app. Works for sessions in the desktop app too, once Claude Code has signed in on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列表里有 Claude Code 会话时，每五分钟运行一次你自己的 claude 程序并执行 /usage。Claude Code 会用它自己的登录去问 Anthropic，和你手动输入 /usage 完全一样；本应用只读取它保存在 ~/.claude.json 里的结果，从不读取登录凭据。只要 Claude Code 在这台 Mac 上登录过，桌面端里的会话同样适用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Same as macOS": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随 macOS"
          }
        }
      }
