            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理停下后显示在会话行里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign-in, if your server asks: user:password, or an ntfy token": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器需要登录时填写：用户名:密码，或 ntfy 访问令牌"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跳过"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Small": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Small while they work, open when they need you": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "干活时小小一块，需要你时才展开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some tools rewrite an agent's config and drop entries they do not know. A connected agent whose hooks went missing is connected again, at most every ten minutes, and the island says so. Removing an agent here or with niko-island uninstall stops this for it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有些工具会重写代理的配置，并丢掉它们不认识的条目。已接入代理的钩子不见了时会重新接入（每个代理最多十分钟一次），小岛会告诉你。在这里移除代理或运行 niko-island uninstall 后就不会再放回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sound set": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "音效方案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sounds": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "音效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Standard": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start an agent and it will show up here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启动一个代理，它就会出现在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start using Niko Island": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始使用 Niko Island"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stay quiet while the screen is locked or asleep": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕锁定或休眠时保持安静"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop auto-approving": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止自动批准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop being quiet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "结束免打扰"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped with an error": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "因出错而停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sun": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell me when there is a new version": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有新版本时告诉我"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text size": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The GitHub CLI (gh) has not signed in on this Mac, so there is nothing to ask with.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub CLI（gh）还没有在这台 Mac 上登录，没有可用来查询的凭据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app could not be replaced: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法替换应用：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cue plays again, up to three times, and a line goes to your phone if that is switched on. Not while the screen is locked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示音会再响一次，最多三次；如果开了手机推送，也会发一条。屏幕锁定时不提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download did not finish.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载没有完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download did not match the release's checksum, so it was not used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载的文件与发布附带的校验和不符，没有使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download is not this app, so it was not used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载的不是本应用，没有使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The five-hour and weekly use of the agent you used last, with the time to each reset. Click it for Usage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近使用的代理的 5 小时与每周额度用量，以及离重置还有多久。点击打开用量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The gear on the island opens Settings. This welcome is under About, if you want to see it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点小岛上的齿轮打开设置。想再看一遍这段介绍，可以在“关于”里找到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The introduction from the first launch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次启动时的那段介绍。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key was not accepted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密钥没有被接受。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last line was accepted by the server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上一条消息已被服务器接受。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plan ZCode draws on. ZCode keeps its own key locked away, so this needs a key of that plan from you. It is stored in your Keychain and sent only to the service chosen below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "也就是 ZCode 使用的套餐。ZCode 把自己的密钥加密保存了，所以需要你提供该套餐的一个密钥。它会保存在你的钥匙串里，只发送到下面选定的服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The provider answered in a form this version does not read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "厂商返回的格式，这个版本还读不懂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The provider asked for a pause. Trying again in a few minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "厂商要求稍后再试，几分钟后会自动重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The provider could not be reached.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法连接到厂商。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server could not be reached.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接不上服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server said no (%lld). Check the key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器拒绝了（%lld），请检查 Key。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no key yet, or the server address cannot be used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有 Key，或者服务器地址不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These agents are on your Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在你的 Mac 上发现了这些代理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the latest version.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已是最新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is what a line from your Mac looks like.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "来自你 Mac 的一行消息就是这个样子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This release has no package for this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个版本没有适合这台 Mac 的安装包。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Through a push service you set up yourself. It says which agent, which project and what kind of moment, to the one server below and nowhere else. Off until you turn it on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过你自己设置的推送服务发送。内容只有：哪个代理、哪个项目、发生了哪一类事；只发给下面这一个服务器，不发往别处。默认关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thu": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "四"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tight": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "紧凑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tokens by weekday and hour, last 4 weeks": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近 4 周按星期和小时统计的 token"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tokens per day, last 7 days": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近 7 天每日 token 数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tokens per month, last 12 months": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近 12 个月每月 token 数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tokens per quarter hour, last 24 hours": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近 24 小时每 15 分钟的 token"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tokens, cost and limits": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Token、费用与限额"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tool calls, monthly": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工具调用（每月）"
          }
        }
