    },
    "Tue": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "二"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on %@ underneath it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开它下面的 %@ 开关"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Allow notifications for Niko Island": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为 Niko Island 打开“允许通知”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn sounds on": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开音效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turned down: a session only brings %@ forward, not its tab.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已拒绝：点击会话只会切到 %@，到不了对应的标签页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turned off in System Settings, so no banner appears.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已在系统设置中关闭，不会弹出横幅。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type something else…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入其他内容…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under a heading per project or per agent. The group with something that needs you comes first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按项目或按代理分到各自的标题下。有事等你处理的那一组排在最前面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Until": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "到"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Usage": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Usage tracking is unavailable: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用量统计不可用：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ is out. Installing puts the old app in the Trash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 版已发布。安装时旧应用会被移到废纸篓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ · no telemetry, no account, MIT licensed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %@ · 无遥测、无需账号、MIT 许可"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version and privacy": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本与隐私"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Volume": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "音量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the switch…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待打开开关…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for you in %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在 %@ 里等你"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wants to use %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "想要使用 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warn me when a plan window reaches": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "套餐窗口用到多少时提醒我"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warnings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch the island at the top of the screen: this is what it does all day.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "看屏幕顶部的小岛：这就是它每天做的事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weekly limit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每周限额"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weekly, %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每周（%@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is listed, and for how long": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列出什么、保留多久"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What the island is drawn on. On a display with a camera housing the closed island stays black, to match it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "灵动岛的底色与质感。在有摄像头刘海的屏幕上，收起的灵动岛保持黑色，与刘海融为一体。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When an agent finishes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理完成时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When an agent wants to run something, the island opens with the command. Allow, deny, or send it back to the terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理想执行命令时，小岛会展开并显示这条命令。允许、拒绝，或者交回终端处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When, last 4 weeks": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "什么时候用，最近 4 周"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where there is no menu bar": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在没有菜单栏的地方"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where there is no menu bar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "也就是没有菜单栏的地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where your MiniMax account is: minimaxi.com in mainland China, minimax.io elsewhere.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 MiniMax 账号所在：中国大陆为 minimaxi.com，其他地区为 minimax.io。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While the terminal or app a session runs in is in front, its requests and finished turns stay on the closed island instead of opening it: you are already looking at them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话所在的终端或应用在前台时，它的请求和完成的回合只显示在收起的小岛上，不会自动弹开：你本来就在看着它。"
          }
        }
